  "title": "Child starting school",
  "highlighted": true,
  "category": "Education & Learning",
  "body": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "value": "<p>Enrolling a child in primary school, the supports available, and what to do if you do not get a place. Most families start this in the year before their child starts school.</p>",
      "id": "le-1104"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "value": "<p>For older children moving on from secondary school, see <a href=\"https://www.gov.ie/en/life-events/transition-from-secondary-to-tertiary-education/\" data-page-id=\"1105\" data-api-url=\"https://api.example.gov.ie/v2/pages/1105/\">Transition from Secondary to Tertiary Education</a>.</p>",
      "id": "le-1104-p2"
    }
  ],
